              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kumelwe bafundise abantu bami umehluko phakathi kokungcwele nokungangcwele futhi babenze bahlukanise phakathi kokungcolile nokuhlanzekile.",
          "type": "text",
