              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Futhi bangasondeli kofileyo ukuba bamngcolise; kodwa ngenxa kayise noma unina noma indodana noma indodakazi, umfowabo noma udadewabo ababengenandoda bangazingcolisa.",
          "type": "text",
