              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngosuku lapho engena endlini engcwele egcekeni elingaphakathi ukukhonza endlini engcwele, kumelwe anikele umnikelo wakhe wesono, isho iNkosi uJehova.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
