              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okokuqala kwakho konke okokuqala kwakho konke nayo yonke iminikelo eyenziwa ngomlilo yakho konke kuzo zonke izinhlobo zeminikelo yenu eyenziwa ngomlilo kuyakuba ngokompristi; Ingqalo yenhlama yenu niyakunika umpristi, ukuze aphumule isibusiso endlini yakho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
